---
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<footer class="colophon">
  <div><strong>岛主编剧工坊</strong><p>作者与合作　<a href={base+'/about/'}>认识岛主</a>　<a href="mailto:daozhu1993@gmail.com">写邮件</a>　<a href="https://xhslink.cn/o/1t4rhxxzVDc">小红书</a></p><p>微信　bl-free</p></div>
  <div><p><a href="https://www.daozhuai.cn/islands/">返回数字群岛 ↗</a>　<a href="https://www.daozhuai.cn/">岛主主站</a></p><p><a href="https://me.daozhuai.cn/">小岛手记</a>　<a href="https://dailyone.daozhuai.cn/">AI 日报</a>　<a href="https://inspo.daozhuai.cn/">设计灵感</a></p>
  <button type="button" id="sound-control" aria-pressed="false">界面音效 · 关</button></div>
</footer>
<style>
.colophon{margin-top:auto;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:26px;padding:38px max(6vw,20px) 65px;background:#111613;border-top:1px solid #3d4439;color:#b9bcae;font-size:13px}
strong{font:700 22px 'Songti SC',serif;color:#f2ede0}.colophon p{margin:8px 0}.colophon a:hover,.colophon button:hover{color:#f1d295}.colophon button{min-height:40px}
</style>
<script is:inline>
(function(){const button=document.querySelector('#sound-control');function show(on){button.textContent='界面音效 · '+(on?'开':'关');button.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(on))}try{show(localStorage.getItem('cinema_sfx_muted')==='false')}catch{}button.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(window.cinemaAudio)show(window.cinemaAudio.toggle())})})();
</script>
